{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close Call Extreme is a fast, stylish arcade dodger where you slip through traffic, skim past bumpers by a pixel, and chase those long, heart-pounding high-score runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every close call matters, and one mistake might end it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752530/extras/8e2cb87cb01b02397c09643f43ef3a8d.poster.avif?t=1770763844\" width=430 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752530/extras/8e2cb87cb01b02397c09643f43ef3a8d.webm?t=1770763844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752530/extras/8e2cb87cb01b02397c09643f43ef3a8d.mp4?t=1770763844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless, high-speed arcade driving where every near-miss boosts your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain close calls to build massive combos and extend your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No brakes; only speed, control, and nerve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash takes you to pit, slows you down</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER THE CLOSE CALL</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision matters more than speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track changes will test your focus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying calm is part of the challenge </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE MORE RUN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close Call Extreme is built for short sessions, long streaks, and that <i>just one more try</i> feeling.<br>Focus, take risks, and see how far you can push it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s a better emotional exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close Call Extreme is inspired by classic arcade racers and the kind of high-speed, high-focus driving games many of us grew up with, including endless racers from the C64 era like LeMans.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/752530?t=1770763844","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770763844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752530/de50739b0c47b708a37d051220f00b54bec332b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770763844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752530/de50739b0c47b708a37d051220f00b54bec332b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770763844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close Call Extreme is a fast, stylish arcade dodger where you slip through traffic, skim past bumpers by a pixel, and chase those long, heart-pounding high-score runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every close call matters, and one mistake might end it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752530/extras/8e2cb87cb01b02397c09643f43ef3a8d.poster.avif?t=1770763844\" width=430 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752530/extras/8e2cb87cb01b02397c09643f43ef3a8d.webm?t=1770763844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752530/extras/8e2cb87cb01b02397c09643f43ef3a8d.mp4?t=1770763844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless, high-speed arcade driving where every near-miss boosts your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain close calls to build massive combos and extend your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No brakes; only speed, control, and nerve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash takes you to pit, slows you down</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER THE CLOSE CALL</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision matters more than speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track changes will test your focus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying calm is part of the challenge </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE MORE RUN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close Call Extreme is built for short sessions, long streaks, and that <i>just one more try</i> feeling.<br>Focus, take risks, and see how far you can push it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s a better emotional exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close Call Extreme is inspired by classic arcade racers and the kind of high-speed, high-focus driving games many of us grew up with, including endless racers from the C64 era like LeMans.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Dreamfold"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752530/e978dfbd6a75615abeb553556fac3b116dea3dc5/header.jpg?t=1770763844","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/752530/1183478307/